{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "367b60c2-c987-8d36-a7a4-0b5f80e9bb80",
  "created_at": "2026-01-07T10:22:42-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colin Reardon",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:20:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:20:39-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. My name is Colin Reardon. I am calling about water and sewer bill for one thirty-one Harrison Avenue. I received a reminder notice yesterday, and this is first I hear of any bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:20:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a reminder and no original bill. Let me pull that up. Can you spell the last name for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:20:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "R-E-A-R-D-O-N. But the account, it is not in my name. It is in name of my wife, she has passed. The bill, I think, went to old address. Nobody told me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:21:09-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about your wife. Yeah, I see it here. The account is still under her name and the mailing address on file is the old one. That's why the original never reached you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:21:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So [line breaks up] this is why. I am a little annoyed, to be honest. A reminder with late fee, and I never saw the first one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:21:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Let me update the mailing address to Harrison Avenue so this doesn't repeat. Do you want the account name changed too? That's a separate form, I can send it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:21:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please send form. First I need to pay this. Is there a way to pay when office is closed? I work during the day. Is there a drop box?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:21:51-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is. There's a payment drop box at City Hall, you can leave a check or money order with the bill stub in it. Don't put cash in there. You can also pay online anytime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:22:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, drop box. I will write check tonight. I have a stack of winter coats here to sort for donation drive, so I will be busy, but I do this tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:22:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Write the account number on the check, and I'll note that you called today about the address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:22:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you are breaking up. [inaudible] Account number on the check, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:22:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right, account number on the check. And I'll email the name-change form over, or mail it to the new address, whichever you like."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:22:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail it, please. To Harrison Avenue. Thank you, Tony."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T10:22:39-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Take care, Mr. Reardon."
    }
  ],
